# Key Learnings

### 1. AI Can Organize Unstructured Information

Large meeting transcripts can be converted into structured dashboards within seconds.

---

### 2. Reusable Skills Improve Productivity

Creating a Custom Skill eliminates the need to rewrite prompts for every meeting.

---

### 3. Better Organization Leads to Better Execution

Clear action items, risks, and ownership improve project tracking and collaboration.

---

### 4. Prompt Engineering Enables Workflow Automation

Well-designed prompts can automate repetitive documentation and planning tasks.

